flowchart TB
    I[Discord/API Intent] --> S[Hermes Session]
    S --> C[Resolve Binding + Context]
    C --> D{Durable work?}
    D -->|No| A[Direct answer / delegate_task]
    D -->|Yes| M[AGK Mission]
    M --> K[Hermes Root Kanban Task]
    K --> G[Task Graph]
    G --> R[Research / Architecture]
    R --> E[Engineering]
    E --> P[Ponytail Review]
    P --> V[Deterministic Verify]
    V --> Q[QA]
    Q --> SEC[Security]
    SEC --> REV[Independent Review]
    REV -->|Changes| E
    REV -->|Pass| PR[PR]
    PR --> CI[CI]
    CI --> ST[Staging]
    ST --> LV[Live Verify]
    LV --> PROD[Production]
    PROD --> SRE[SRE Verify]
    SRE --> EV[Evidence]
    EV --> SYNC[Linear / Notion / Memory]
    EV --> DIS[Discord Final Report]
